  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.14.6 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 👷 ci: pin ubuntu-26.04, clear warnings, bump deps by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3378\n* fix(ci): defer upgrades blocked by release age by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3379\n* ci: overlap release transfers and verification by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3382\n* 🐛 fix(seed): guard every embed update log read, not just one by @darrenhuai in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3383\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.14.5...21.14.6",
